# .gitmore
# Custom file for repository cleanup metadata.
# List paths or patterns that should be removed when creating a clean copy of the repo.
# This is not a replacement for .gitignore; it's a helper for your cleanup scripts or notes.

# Common build / IDE artifacts to remove
bin/
obj/
.vs/
TestResults/
packages/
node_modules/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.log
*.nupkg
*.zip

# Add any additional project-specific paths below:
# path/to/unwanted
